# Project-level agent assets (rules, skills, durable memory) ARE project
# property and are tracked. Root AGENTS.md remains the single execution entry.

# Excluded: daily per-task chronicles ONLY. Durable facts belong in
# memory/MEMORY.md and the topic files it indexes; dated notes stay local.
memory/20??-??-*.md
memory/daily/
